cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TB-BTR data, annotations, or analysis code, please cite this record together with the original studies listed in Supplementary Table S1."
title: "TB-BTR: Tuberculosis Blood Transcriptome Resource"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  TB-BTR is a curated and analysis-ready resource of human blood transcriptome
  studies for tuberculosis research. Publicly deposited microarray and RNA-seq
  studies are assembled into a single catalogue with harmonised clinical
  phenotypes, documented treatment-interval provenance, participant linkage
  where the source permits, and derived expression and immune-cell profiles.
  The deposit contains the resource inventories, supplementary tables, field
  definitions, and the inputs and code needed to reproduce the fixed
  ATB versus LTBI UC immune-cell analysis.
